From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:05:58 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 009/207] sessions: agree on logical eviction charge and
 restore identity

Adapt florianbrede-ayet's PR #65, with rootsbymenda's independent cap-divergence corroboration in issue #60. Preserve physical RAM accounting while using rank-independent logical disk charges; validate leader restore identity before mutation and preflight the native session protocol. Host tests cover trim traces, wrong and missing identities, and actual control sockets; GPU and pair qualification remain separate.
